{% doc %}
  Renders a "Buy N for X" merchandising pill from the product metafield
  `custom.bundle_offer_pill` (single_line_text). Renders nothing when
  the metafield is blank.

  Shared by the PDP (`blocks/bundle-offer-pill.liquid`), the product
  card (`snippets/product-card.liquid`), and the cart line items
  (`snippets/_cart-line-items.liquid`) so all three surfaces render
  identical markup (ADR-0005-style single source of truth).

  @param {product} product - The product whose metafield is read. Required.
  @param {string} [class] - Extra utility classes appended to the pill,
    e.g. positioning utilities for an image overlay.

  @example
  {% render '_bundle-offer-pill', product: product %}
{% enddoc %}

{% liquid
  assign pill_text = product.metafields.custom.bundle_offer_pill
%}

{%- if pill_text != blank -%}
  <span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-fg px-2 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-bg {{ class }}">
    {{ pill_text }}
  </span>
{%- endif -%}
